{"evt":"note_created","id":"note-mqacbw9tv85","workspace":"/Users/imyu/Desktop/zonoid","title":"Autonomy score is strict: git verified merges only, output tokens only","summary":"Decision 2026-06-12 (user: 'Recompute strictly'). The /costflow autonomy score counts ONLY output_tokens flowing to git-verified merged sinks — agent self-reported done status earns no productive credit, and input tokens are never counted as produced work. Rationale: audit found 335/344 lenient sinks had no git merge and ~2.3M input tokens were mislabeled as output; lenient gave 103.5×/92%, strict gives 72×/75.4% (11.6M of 15.4M output tokens, 3.8M trapped). The lenient-vs-strict gap is itself a finding — agents over-credit self-reported completion, mirroring the METR human self-report gap. Paper 002 (docs/papers/autonomy-score/) documents both.","created_by":"main","valid_from":"2026-06-12T03:02:03.041Z","vec":[0.03644406050443649,-0.053347937762737274,-0.020154833793640137,-0.026800330728292465,0.046454377472400665,-0.08449692279100418,-0.00008338897896464914,0.06807084381580353,0.023046962916851044,0.050588663667440414,0.09368149191141129,-0.052499644458293915,0.060936715453863144,0.03790212422609329,-0.005828335881233215,0.014059950597584248,-0.01651051454246044,0.04717157036066055,-0.05662393569946289,-0.023181864991784096,-0.12191322445869446,0.03544696420431137,-0.006384300999343395,0.057441432029008865,0.09703310579061508,-0.026722079142928123,-0.044039253145456314,0.018921121954917908,-0.05142306908965111,-0.036407794803380966,0.024363724514842033,0.007687360513955355,0.05044685676693916,0.07313580811023712,0.04755489528179169,0.09869428724050522,0.024225156754255295,-0.10882554203271866,0.06497857719659805,-0.05119561403989792,0.04062268137931824,-0.026013517752289772,0.03240341320633888,-0.02855602465569973,-0.04355756938457489,0.07892604172229767,-0.07468809187412262,-0.11473432928323746,-0.027453092858195305,-0.01018580887466669,-0.026140717789530754,-0.000540648412425071,-0.02